[h2]Build 0.9.5[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Conveyor arm[/b] (needs Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Factory): one building with two jobs, switched with a button. As a [b]Loader[/b] it takes from the storage behind it and puts goods onto the conveyor in front. As a [b]Feeder[/b] it stands at the end of a belt and puts what arrives into the factory machine's input hopper in front of it.
[*]The arms work as a network: the Feeder reads what its machine's current process still needs, and the Loaders on the belts leading to it send exactly that, counting what is already on its way, so nothing is over-sent. Belts can merge and pass through underground conveyors.
[*]Anything reaching a Feeder that is no longer wanted is set down beside it, so belts never jam.
[*]Found in VFE's Factories build tab after Basic Factories research. Without VFE Factory installed, none of this loads.
[/list]
